{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日で乃木坂46結成5周年ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は2期生だから、\nまるまる5年の乃木坂の全ては\nわからないけど、\nそれでも乃木坂46というグループがだいすきで\n乃木坂として毎日過ごしていく中で\nメンバーもスタッフさんも\n応援して下さる皆さんのことも\nだいすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が乃木坂のためになにができるのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を応援してくださる皆さんに\nどうやったら恩返しができるのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えて毎日がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも乃木坂46をよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから！欅坂46さん\n結成1周年おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/21/9132161/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/21/9132161/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目ーーーがーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/21/9132161/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合ーーーうーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/21/9132161/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ですが、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏さんと白石さん\nお誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/21/9132161/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんながだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DDではなく\nMDなのだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織とべたべた～\n伊織～\n毎日となり～\nべたべた～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/21/9132161/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車に乗って遠くまで行きたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いたことない駅名でおりて\n探検したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マップも見ちゃだめで\n行き当たりばったりの\n日帰り旅行！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや！旅行にもならないかなっ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行き当たりばったりのサバイバル！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！これだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな日を朝から夜まで過ごして\nその1日は短く感じるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長く感じるのかなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうなんだろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/21/9132161/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なに書きたかったか思い出した！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10年前の自分から届いた\nお手紙のはなしだ！"}],"source":"archive"}